            "status": "reverted",
            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "reverted_by": "ICanGuessItLol",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "What is the difference between a \"good\" child and a \"bad\" one? Maybe Santa can tell the difference, but for the rest of us, it isn't always so easy to know. Are you \"good\" if you listen? Show respect? Do well in school? Do all of these and more? Whatever it means to be a good child, it does not mean being perfect. It does involve qualities like compassion, understanding, self-discipline, and appreciation though.<ref>[v161095_b01]. 24 July 2019.</ref> Maybe one way to think of it is this: Good children put themselves on the path toward becoming happy, successful adults. Any parent would appreciate this type of \"good\" child.You have to poo and then your parent will love you. them break a bone or get hurt on purpose then your parent will love you"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "What is the difference between a \"good\" child and a \"bad\" one? Maybe Santa can tell the difference, but for the rest of us, it isn't always so easy to know. Are you \"good\" if you listen? Show respect? Do well in school? Do all of these and more? Whatever it means to be a good child, it does not mean being perfect. It does involve qualities like compassion, understanding, self-discipline, and appreciation though.<ref>[v161095_b01]. 24 July 2019.</ref> Maybe one way to think of it is this: Good children put themselves on the path toward becoming happy, successful adults. Any parent would appreciate this type of \"good\" child."
                ]
