            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "{{nointroimg}}This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes.",
                    ""
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "[[Image:Be a Good Child Intro.jpg|right|300px]]This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes."
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "9632407",
            "user": "Wikiphoto",
            "timestamp": "19:01, 16 April 2013",
            "anon": false,
            "size": "(2,758 bytes)",
            "change": 64,
            "summary": "(Enlarging and centering Steps photos)",
            "is_minor": false,
            "is_expert": false,
            "status": "active",
            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#'''[[Be Yourself|Be yourself]].''' Well, if you don't know the real you, just act naturally, the self you are most laid back and comfortable in.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 1.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Do as you would like to be done to you. [[Listen|Listen]] to people and make everyone feel good.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 2.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Stay [[Be Calm|calm]]! If you yell a lot and are argumentative, people won't want to be around you.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 3.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Don't use bad language. Most people don't think bad language is cool. They think it makes you look stupid.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 4.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Honor your parents. Don't lie to them, and don't do any sneaky stuff, because they know what you're doing anyway, there's no way around it. Help them to build a wall of trust for you, but when you get it, don't let it fall down again!<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 5.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Do well in school. Listen to everything your teacher says, take notes, and even make little practice tests for you to practice your skills.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 6.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "#Get along with your friends and family, especially with your brothers and sisters. That part can be hard.<br><br>[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 7.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    ""
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 1.jpg|right|300px]]'''[[Be Yourself|Be yourself]].''' Well, if you don't know the real you, just act naturally, the self you are most laid back and comfortable in.",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 2.jpg|right|300px]]Do as you would like to be done to you. [[Listen|Listen]] to people and make everyone feel good.",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 3.jpg|right|300px]]Stay [[Be Calm|calm]]! If you yell a lot and are argumentative, people won't want to be around you.",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 4.jpg|right|300px]]Don't use bad language. Most people don't think bad language is cool. They think it makes you look stupid.",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 5.jpg|right|300px]]Honor your parents. Don't lie to them, and don't do any sneaky stuff, because they know what you're doing anyway, there's no way around it. Help them to build a wall of trust for you, but when you get it, don't let it fall down again!",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 6.jpg|right|300px]]Do well in school. Listen to everything your teacher says, take notes, and even make little practice tests for you to practice your skills.",
                    "#[[Image:Be a Good Child Step 7.jpg|right|300px]]Get along with your friends and family, especially with your brothers and sisters. That part can be hard."
                ]
            }
        },
