                    "#Do as you would like to be done to you. [[Listen|Listen]] to people and",
                    "make everyone feel good.",
                    "#Stay [[Be Calm|calm]]! If you yell a lot and are argumentative, people",
                    "won't want to be around you.",
                    "#Don't use bad language. Most people don't think bad language is cool.",
                    "They think it makes you look stupid.",
