                ],
                "removed": [
                    "Hello my name is skye price. My article is about how to be a good child. It is good to be a good child because you get lots of cool awards and special treats. I try to be a good child but it is really hard because certain thing or people you just have to be mean to. It is hard but you have to treat people like you want to be treated. Thats all for my introduction to day. Next I will be moving on to my article.",
