                    "",
                    "== Tips ==",
                    "*If you are about to be punished, accept it. For example, if you have been rude, and are about to be spanked, don't whine and moan, simply apologise and get ready for your punishment.",
                    "",
                    "== Things You'll Need ==",
                    "*The ability to swallow your pride.",
                    "*[[Be a Good Kid|How to Be a Good Kid]]"
                ],
                "removed": []
            }
        },
