            "contribution_type": "deletion",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "{{format|date=2009-03-24}}This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes."
                ]
            }
