                    "{{format|date=2009-03-24}}This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes."
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "{{format|date=2009-03-24}}This page is all about how to be ''a good child'', which is different than being \"a good kid\". Being a good child implies how you behave towards your parents, whereas being a good kid is more about being good on an individual basis. If you are a good child, your parents will trust you, you'll get good grades, and your life will be much happier thanks to these changes.All you have to do is set the first three step in becoming the good child in the family so if you want to know the first three steps well here they are,STEP 1 if you are in the store with a brother of sister and they are bothering you like saying lets go in the other isle [i-el] and look at the toys all you have to say is NO I am going to start listening but if you want to go in the other isle by yourself then that is your decision not mine it is very simple.STEP 2 listen to your  parents or your babysitter or whoever is watching you if they  ask you to clean your room or do your homework or if you have a baby brother or sister if they ask you to make a bottle of change the diaper then listen to them and do what they say or if you want to stay home alone one day with your baby brother or sister then they won't be able to trust you by yourself because they will think that you won't be doing your homework or making a bottle or changing the diaper so make sure your parents can trust you.STEP 3 you don't always have to agree with everything your parents say almost no one always agrees with their parents and if you are feeling left out because you are the oldest child and you have 2 little siblings then don't just stand there and take it talk to your parents tell them that you want to spend more time with just them ask them nicely if they can find a sitter for you little brother or sister for about 3 to 4 hours so just you and them can spend some time together if they say maybe don't get annoyed and start crying say ok and don't keep on bugging them about it that will just get them annoyed and make it worse ok well those are the steps into becoming a good child and good luck."
                ]
            }
        },
